NVIDIA cuRAND
Copyright 2010-2014 NVIDIA Corporation

The cuRAND headers are NOT open source. Their own header states the Licensed
Deliverables are "PROPRIETARY and CONFIDENTIAL to NVIDIA" and that
reproduction or disclosure to any third party without express written consent
is prohibited.

No cuRAND source is in this repository. isolation_forest/derived/curand/
implements the XORWOW generator, which is Marsaglia (2003) and published; its
precalculated transition matrices are REBUILT from the step function rather
than copied (DEVIATION 683), and the committed fixtures are this project's own
generator output. NVIDIA's tables are read from a local header at check time
only and are not tracked here.

Recorded pending a decision by the author.
